OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny intervals. There will also
OL,7,Fbe a few showers, turning heavier in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Strong southwesterly
OL,9,Fwinds, perhaps touching gale force
OL,10,Fover the Isles.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly cloudy with showers
OL,13,Fmerging into some longer spells of
OL,14,Frain, heaviest over the Northwest
OL,15,FHighlands. Strong to gale force
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
