OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy morning with showers
OL,6,For longer spells of rain and strong to
OL,7,Fgale force westerly winds. Wind and
OL,8,Fshowers will ease during the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith some bright or sunny intervals.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,12,Fon Wednesday with some sunny spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping. Rain spreading from the
OL,14,Fwest on Thursday. Then brighter again
OL,15,Fon Friday with some sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
